        "en": "Are pet owners able to consult directly with their groomer?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate speaking directly with their assigned groomer at drop-off to discuss breed styling preferences and specific trimming instructions."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is daycare available for pets before or after styling?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The salon offers cage-free daycare areas where dogs can socialize and play before and after their grooming appointments."
      },
